@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 230
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam noteBorderColor #C9A227
actor "Early fan" as F
actor "Late fan" as L
participant "CDN + bot check" as CDN
participant "Waiting room" as WR
database "Redis" as R
== Before T0: the lobby (T-30 min to T0) ==
F -> CDN : open event page
CDN --> F : static page + challenge passed (cookie)
F -> WR : POST /queue (account, challenge cookie)
WR -> R : join.lua: phase is LOBBY\nZADD NX lobby:{e} <secret random> user
R --> WR : added (or "already in": same entry returned)
WR --> F : queueToken {event, user, kind=LOBBY} signed
note over F : sees a countdown, no number yet.\nArriving at T-30 or T-1 makes no difference
== T0: the draw becomes final ==
WR -> R : SET phase:{e} QUEUE\nN = ZCARD lobby:{e} ; SET next:{e} N
note over R : order of the sorted set = order of the\nrandom scores = the lottery result
F -> WR : GET /queue/me (sent with 0-20 s random delay)
WR -> R : ZRANK lobby:{e} user
R --> WR : rank 412,376
WR --> F : seq = 412,377 (signed)
== After T0: plain first come, first served ==
L -> WR : POST /queue
WR -> R : join.lua: phase is QUEUE -> INCR next:{e}
R --> WR : 1,000,214
WR --> L : queueToken with seq = 1,000,214
@enduml
